# --- Delfys75 reproduction (see delfys75_audit/README.md) ---
# Regenerable data and code copies (~39 GB): Kaggle v11 + checksums in Results/repro_d75/preprocessing/
repro_d75_work/
# Per-run checkpoints, plots and config copies written by main.py inside each run folder
Results/repro_d75/*/work/
# Keep the small result JSONs (per-epoch param_logs/*.json stay ignored)
!Results/repro_d75/preprocessing/*.json
!Results/repro_d75/validation_old_csvs/*.json
# Keep the paper PDFs
!paper/pdf/*.pdf
